==Battleground==
*5 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*6 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Cli-One]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Abuse Sir Metal Seal to stack Wave Attackers on, like [[Masked Grandmaster Cat]]. Use [[Future Cat]] to tank everyone here, while [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Storm Beast Naala]] can snipe Loris. Once Cli-One is dead, use a Critter to clean it up and win.

